ull,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-30T09:21:30","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"3cd68281-cbdd-4f5a-ab26-3f289dec6829","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151151429,"PostDateInt":1772586335000,"PostDate":"2026-03-04T09:05:35","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"复合机器人-感知与抓取算法工程师","OrgId":1764303,"Org":"启智智能机器人","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市","安徽省·芜湖市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责工业场景下无序抓取与柔性上料的感知算法研发，包括但不限于：多模态3D视觉位姿估计、分割与抓取点/抓取位姿生成、遮挡与堆叠场景下的抓取可行性推理；\n2、研发面向复合机器人的抓取策略学习与泛化方法，引入并落地端到端抓取模型（如 Diffusion Policy、VLA 架构中的动作头设计），提升对未见工件的零样本/少样本泛化能力；\n3、探索大模型在抓取任务中的应用：利用视觉-语言模型进行目标指代理解（如“抓取左侧那个黑色支架”）、任务拆解与抓取顺序规划；\n4、将抓取能力封装为可被上层任务规划器调用的标准化技能接口，支持“感知-决策-抓取-反馈”闭环中的感知侧反馈与失败重试机制；\n5、参与构建抓取数据集 pipeline（含仿真合成数据与真机示教数据），设计 Sim2Real 迁移方案，推动算法在真实工业现场稳定落地；\n6、跟踪具身智能、3D视觉抓取、多模态大模型在机器人操作中的前沿进展，快速评估并引入可工程化的方案。","Require":"1、硕士及以上学历，相关专业；\n2、过往项目以抓取感知、视觉引导抓取、或机器人操作策略学习为主；\n3、熟悉 3D 视觉数据处理（点云分割、位姿估计、6D抓取检测），有实际工业无序分拣或 bin-picking 项目落地经验者优先；\n4、熟悉主流深度学习/多模态模型架构（CNN、Transformer、VLM/VLA），有大模型在机器人抓取或任务规划中的应用经验者优先（微调、Prompt Engineering、Agent 工具调用均可）；\n5、熟悉 Python、C++，熟悉 ROS/ROS2 及真实机器人系统调试。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-04T09:05:35","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f3ca9c4b-c371-416e-9ca2-6fe8d9123c3d","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151151427,"PostDateInt":1772586140000,"PostDate":"2026-03-04T09:02:20","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"人形机器人-C++开发工程师","OrgId":1764303,"Org":"启智智能机器人","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·芜湖市","浙江省·杭州市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责实时系统模块的设计，代码的编写及优化，以及相关代码的测试；\n2、负责底层外设及接口驱动的移植、开发、调试以及优化；\n3、负责开源EtherCAT主站封装测试及优化部署；\n4、负责机器人主控系统软件基于ROS的系统方案设计与平台软件开发；\n5、开发所需的软件系统，包括但不限于系统优化、驱动开发、通信开发、系统程序开发与测试等。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，计算机、自动化、